  ('zcrm_5797994000002209139', 'fasten health', 'fasten health', 'Zachary Caporale', 'Jason Kulatunga', 'Operator of a unified medical record platform intended to simplify access to patient health data. The company specializes in unified API access, native FHIR exports, instant account connection, and patient-empowered data sharing, enabling developers to create secure and efficient health data applications.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2025', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Zack Caporale', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-01-30 05:57:57', '2025-04-30 08:29:48', '2025-04-30 08:29:48'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002209168', 'tuva', 'tuva health', 'Zachary Caporale', 'Jorge Zuloaga', 'Developer of a healthcare data management software designed to clean and transform messy healthcare data. The company''s software specializes in fixing data quality issues by offering services that include normalizing, unifying, enriching and quality-testing raw claims and medical record data to enable analytics, artificial intelligence development and real-world evidence applications, enabling healthcare providers to build data blocks more efficiently.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2025', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Zack Caporale', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-01-30 06:03:28', '2025-04-30 08:29:44', '2025-04-30 08:29:44'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002209192', 'Abacus Insights', 'Abacus insights', 'Zachary Caporale', 'Dr Patel', 'Developer of a data integration platform designed to harness the healthcare data explosion. The company''s platform curates and organizes healthcare data from multiple sources and in different formats while using advanced analytics to have continuous innovation, enabling healthcare companies to generate actionable insights, improve the consumer experience, lower the cost of care, and improve care quality.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2025', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Zack Caporale', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-01-30 06:09:50', '2025-04-30 08:29:41', '2025-04-30 08:29:41'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002209216', 'Cornerstone AI', 'Cornerstone AI', 'Zachary Caporale', 'Mike Elashoff', 'Developer of an artificial intelligence-based healthcare platform designed to analyze clinical data. The company''s platform provides automatic identification and correction of errors, standardization of text fields, imputation of missing data, and harmonization of clinical datasets, enabling companies to use more of their data faster and arrive at more precise analyses.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2025', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Zack Caporale', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-01-30 06:15:13', '2025-04-30 08:29:38', '2025-04-30 08:29:38'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002209240', 'Cercle', 'Cercle AI', 'Zachary Caporale', 'Juan Riveiro', 'Developer of an artificial intelligence-driven healthcare insights platform designed to enhance data utilization for women''s healthcare providers The company platform transforms extensive healthcare data into real-time, high-quality insights, enabling providers, payors, and pharmaceutical companies to improve operational efficiency and deliver personalized care while navigating the complexities of women''s health data management.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2025', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Zack Caporale', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-01-30 06:19:34', '2025-04-30 08:29:34', '2025-04-30 08:29:34'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002209264', 'Korio', 'Korio', 'Zachary Caporale', 'Ryan Keane', 'Developer of a compliance-centric platform designed for randomization and trial supply management. The company''s role-based interface features randomization, trial supply management and data management functionalities and also gives direct access to the leadership team, enabling users to work efficiently and with confidence.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2025', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Zack Caporale', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-01-30 06:23:39', '2025-04-30 08:29:31', '2025-04-30 08:29:31'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002209288', 'Rhino Health', 'Rhino Health', 'Zachary Caporale', 'Ittai Dayan', 'Developer of a federated learning and edge-computing platform designed to allow artificial intelligence (AI) /data-science developers to collaborate without sharing data or compromising data privacy. The company''s platform distributed computing technologies AI models can quickly and continuously improve by learning from each new dataset and applying those learnings to the next, without requiring costly and risky data transfers, helping users to accelerate the creation and training of more accurate models that work consistently across different patient populations.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2025', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Zack Caporale', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-01-30 06:28:58', '2025-04-30 08:29:27', '2025-04-30 08:29:27'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002209312', 'LateralCare', 'LateralCare', 'Zachary Caporale', 'Scott Smith', 'Developer of revenue cycle management platform designed for the healthcare industry. The company''s product ''alai'' leverages advanced generative artificial intelligence to streamline data management by centralizing healthcare data and provide contextual insights along with identifying and rectifying errors in the revenue cycle, enabling clients to optimize processes for operational effectiveness and improve cash flow ensuring quicker access to revenue and maintaining financial health and reduce payment delays and prevent revenue losses.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2025', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Zack Caporale', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-01-30 06:34:03', '2025-04-30 08:29:23', '2025-04-30 08:29:23'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002209336', 'Yonalink', 'Yonalink', 'Zachary Caporale', 'Iddo Peleg', 'Developer of a medical research database platform designed to migrate clinical research data saved in health records in an automated and secure way. The company''s platform allows the management of the clinical trial operations and vendors management, accelerates the development of new drugs and medical devices, patient diversity and enrollment, and more, enabling healthcare providers and researchers to get a secure, fast, and error-free data capture process.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2025', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Zack Caporale', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-01-30 06:38:03', '2025-04-30 08:29:17', '2025-04-30 08:29:17'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002209355', 'ClaimSorted', NULL, 'Naida Alihodzic', 'German Mikulski', 'A TPA for insurance companies that focuses on claims automation for different types of insurance, including international medical.', 'HV Genesis', 'Financial Innovation', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Naida Alihodzic', 'Rejected', 'Financial Innovation,Needs Attention', NULL, NULL, '2025-02-02 16:46:36', '2025-03-26 06:12:35', '2025-03-26 06:12:35'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002209372', 'Venteur', NULL, 'Naida Alihodzic', 'Stacy Edgar', 'Venteur helps businesses to save money on their health insurance costs, while simultaneously giving their people greater choice and control over their health care. Instead of offering a traditional group health insurance plan, businesses are able to provide their employees with tax-free money via an Individual Coverage Health ReimbursementArrangement (ICHRA). Venteur''s AI decision support tools guide employees on how to spend this money and optimize their health and financial wellness.', 'HV Genesis', 'Financial Innovation', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Naida Alihodzic', 'Rejected', 'Financial Innovation', NULL, NULL, '2025-02-02 17:02:23', '2025-03-01 05:19:48', '2025-03-01 05:19:48'),
