  ('zcrm_5797994000002211377', 'Bastazo', NULL, 'Krish Shah', 'Mauricio Iglesias', 'At Bastazo, we’re transforming how critical infrastructure stays secure with our AI-driven remediation platform. Our solution helps organizations in energy, manufacturing, and oil & gas proactively identify and fix their most critical vulnerabilities, ensuring security and NERC CIP compliance. By combining machine learning, adversary intelligence, and AI-developed remediation plans, we empower security teams to save time and reduce risks, all without adding resources. Let’s connect and discuss how Bastazo can strengthen your cybersecurity strategy.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Krish Shah', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-01-30 09:46:55', '2025-04-29 10:18:35', '2025-04-29 10:18:35'),
