  ('zcrm_5797994000002229080', 'Ceretype Neuromedicine', 'Ceretype Neuromedicine', 'Rosemary Moyo', 'Emily Stern', 'Ceretype has pioneered the integration of fMRI into therapeutic applications in neuropsychiatry. Our uniquely scalable platform makes targeted biomarkers accessible, delivering actionable insights for our pharma/biotech partners. Our decades of expertise across neuromedicine, brain imaging, and industry processes enables innovations that willultimately transform patient care.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Rosemary Moyo', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-03 07:58:55', '2025-08-26 07:45:14', '2025-08-26 07:45:14'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002229104', 'TYBR Health', 'TYBR Health', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Timothy Keane', 'Developer of hydrogel spray designed to protect healing tissues, limit internal scarring, and simplify recovery after surgery. Gel is delivered via a simple and steerable device, and it is compatible with open and minimally invasive operations that reduce adhesions and improve the healing response of a tissue, enabling surgeons to heal scars in patients resulting due to surgical operations that can potentially damage vital internal organs.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-03 08:32:20', '2025-05-14 06:34:36', '2025-05-14 06:34:36'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002229128', 'Nanograb', 'Nanograb', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Debesh Mandal', 'Nanograb generates a combination of binders using AI and a multivalent physics engine. They claim to be the only one to actively minimize binding to the wrong targets and target new parts of the body that have been previously inaccessible.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-03 17:46:25', '2025-05-14 06:34:40', '2025-05-14 06:34:40'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002229152', 'Entheos Labs', 'Entheos Labs', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Tristen Edwards', 'Entheos Labs will be creating a pipeline of new chemical entities from a variety of psychedelic materials and compounds. One of their key goals is to unlock the therapeutic potential of these materials and compounds to address large unmet medical needs in mental healthcare. Entheos Labs will be using a world leading academic neuroimaging center to map for the first time how these newly studied psychedelics interact with the brain.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2025', 'Entheos Labs', 'Have not Reached out', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-03 17:57:46', '2025-05-14 06:35:11', '2025-05-14 06:35:11'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002229176', 'Piezo Therapeutics', 'Piezo Therapeutics', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Gaurav Byagathvalli', 'Piezopen is agnostic to payload and can deliver both DNA and RNA without any changes, enabling broad applications across a range of diseases. Piezopen’s payload capacity is vast, extending from short linear mRNA strands to large self-amplifying RNA constructs and DNA plasmids. They have two components: A piezoelectric generator that produces brief electric pulses for intracellular delivery, and a microneedle electrode array that localize pulses to maximize efficacy and tolerability.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Have not Reached out', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-03 18:17:29', '2025-05-14 06:35:03', '2025-05-14 06:35:03'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002229200', 'Serinus Biosciences', 'Serinus Biosciences', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Adam Yaari', 'Serinus Biosciences is redefining precision in cancer therapeutics. They design models to determine how molecules function inside each tumor cell. Through their knowledge-primed AI engine, they integrate computational biology and functional genomics to uncover the molecular landscape of treatment response or resistance. Their technology enables development of drugs that work across a wide range of patient populations, override resistance mechanisms, and enable combinations by design.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Have not Reached out', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-03 18:32:00', '2025-05-14 06:34:59', '2025-05-14 06:34:59'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002229224', 'Wyndly', 'Wyndly', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Aakash Shah', 'Wyndly gives people with allergies lifelong relief. They ship personalized oral allergy drops that train the immune system to beat personal allergy triggers. With unlimited doctor access and at-home care, they''ve made allergy care convenient. They''re bending the cost curve and making healthcare convenient and accessible.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Have not Reached out', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-03 18:45:22', '2025-05-14 06:34:56', '2025-05-14 06:34:56'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002231020', 'REMspace', 'REMspace', 'Rosemary Moyo', 'Michael Raduga', 'REMspace is a neurotechnology company that offers science-backed devices that help to improve sleep quality.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Rosemary Moyo', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-03 06:47:39', '2025-08-26 07:45:14', '2025-08-26 07:45:14'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002231041', 'Monod Bio', 'Monod Bio', 'Rosemary Moyo', 'David Shoultz', 'Monod Bio is a life sciences company developing biosensors for protein and other analyte detection. Its biosensor platform combines binding, transduction, and amplification to detect a range of target molecules. It utilizes recent advances in computational protein engineering to create highly modular bio-sensing nano switches that stimulate rapid,sensitive, and inexpensive analytical assays. .', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Rosemary Moyo', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-03 07:27:06', '2025-08-26 07:45:14', '2025-08-26 07:45:14'),
