  ('zcrm_5797994000002236239', 'Epistemic AI', 'XtremeX mining', 'Zachary Caporale', 'Stefano Pacifico', 'Developer of a research intelligence platform designed to connect professionals in the life sciences with biomedical knowledge. The company''s web-based application is easy to use and multidisciplinary and uses public and private databases spanning basic research, clinical trial results, and real-world data, enabling professionals to quickly associate diseases, genes, and their variants with chemicals, drugs, pathways, functions, publications, clinical trials and other types of knowledge in a novel, interactive way.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2025', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Zack Caporale', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-03 11:19:45', '2025-04-30 08:29:13', '2025-04-30 08:29:13'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002236274', 'DashLX', 'DashLX', 'Zachary Caporale', 'Adam Stepanovic', 'Developer of sports science and analytics digital platform designed to help runners predict risk, prevent injuries, and perform optimally. The company''s platform takes advantage of data generated by popular wearables and devices and provides basic metrics like distance, time, pace, cadence, and proprietary as well as advanced calculations including power output, critical power, ground contact time, enabling runners, coaches, and physios to make informed training decisions and sustain health.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2025', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Zack Caporale', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-03 11:35:07', '2025-04-30 08:29:06', '2025-04-30 08:29:06'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002236304', 'Dendi', 'Dendi', 'Zachary Caporale', 'Jihoon Baek', 'Developer of a cloud-based laboratory information management software designed to optimize operations, accelerate growth, and support clinical workflows. The company''s system specializes in revenue cycle management, analytics, data administration, multi-facility supports, and instrument integration, enabling clinical laboratories with the tools needed to move forward with speed and confidence.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2025', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Zack Caporale', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-03 11:40:56', '2025-04-30 08:29:02', '2025-04-30 08:29:02'),
