  ('zcrm_5797994000002243260', 'Blueberry Pediatrics', 'Blueberry Pediatrics', 'Pascal Mukendi', 'Harrison Gordon', 'Blueberry Medical provides parents with live access to top pediatricians for a flat monthly rate. Parents get round-the-clock support from a team of top pediatricians who can diagnose illnesses, provide advice and prescribe medication when medically necessary. Parents can send images and videos through a smartphone app, and chat with pediatricians through a text-like interface to ask questions and get care.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sports and Wellness', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Pascal Mukendi', 'Rejected', 'Sports & Wellness,Needs Attention', NULL, NULL, '2025-02-05 06:45:58', '2025-04-29 19:06:36', '2025-04-29 19:06:36'),
