  ('zcrm_5797994000002246035', 'Curimeta', 'Curimeta', 'Zachary Caporale', 'Catherine Matthes', 'Provider of health data intended to help drive the discovery and development of the future of medicine. The company''s platform transforms, curates, and compliantly exchanges privacy-protecting aggregated real-world health data with researchers in healthcare with greater speed and precision to save lives, enabling the healthcare industry to receive indispensable insight to solve urgent scientific and clinical challenges and improve healthcare for all and develop lifesaving cures.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Zack Caporale', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-04 06:00:41', '2025-04-30 08:28:44', '2025-04-30 08:28:44'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002246059', 'Ria Health', 'Ria Health', 'Zachary Caporale', 'David Deacon', 'Provider of telehealth medical services intended to cure people with alcohol addiction. The company''s services offer personalized medical treatment, online coaching, and behavior modification, enabling patients to control alcohol consumption and eliminate associated detriments.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Zack Caporale', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-04 06:07:45', '2025-04-30 08:28:39', '2025-04-30 08:28:39'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002246083', 'Plan Forward', 'Plan Forward', 'Zachary Caporale', 'Megan Lohman', 'Developer of a dental membership software designed to provide uninsured patients with an alternative to traditional dental insurance. The company''s software helps to create a new in-office membership plan, manage existing ones, increase treatment acceptance, grow revenue, and build patient loyalty, enabling dentists to have easy-to-use software with pre-built dashboards to manage membership plans and provide Direct pulp capping (DPC) in dentistry and help them to market their plans and provides all the compliant membership agreements.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Zack Caporale', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-04 06:13:49', '2025-04-30 08:28:35', '2025-04-30 08:28:35'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002246107', 'Beaming Health', 'Beaming Health', 'Zachary Caporale', 'Chris Olmanson', 'Operator of an online healthcare marketplace intended to help families get the help they need for their autistic children. The company''s platform helps users find care providers for autism, ADHD (attention deficit hyperactivity disorder), learning differences, anxiety, and other developmental concerns all covered under insurance, it allows pediatric speech pathologists, occupational therapists, and physical therapists to be independent, in-network providers and it makes it easy for families to get started with them, enabling families with children who have neurodevelopmental conditions to see what therapies to consider.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Zack Caporale', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-04 06:21:20', '2025-04-30 08:28:31', '2025-04-30 08:28:31'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002246131', 'HealthOme', 'HealthOme', 'Zachary Caporale', 'Darren Rowe', 'Developer of health management platform intended to help insurance companies launch omics-based insurance products. The company''s platform bundles genomics-based testing, care navigation, and support network services with critical illness and life insurance products, providing insurance companies with a quick and cost-effective go-to-market strategy for omics-based products.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Zack Caporale', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-04 06:27:42', '2025-04-30 08:28:24', '2025-04-30 08:28:24'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002246158', 'dannce.ai', 'dannce.ai', 'Zachary Caporale', 'Shereen Shermak', 'Developer of a 3-D pose tracking and behavioral quantification platform intended to create digital fingerprints of movement which can be used to identify disease states and drug effects. The company''s platform uses a convolutional neural network to analyze the movement of humans and animals for the diagnosis of diseases and the measurement of therapy effectiveness, enabling healthcare providers to improve the standard of care for neurology.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Zack Caporale', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-04 06:36:55', '2025-04-30 08:28:20', '2025-04-30 08:28:20'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002246182', 'QSM Diagnostics', 'QSM Diagnostics', 'Zachary Caporale', 'Edgar Goluch', 'Operator of a point-of-care veterinary diagnostics development company intended for the rapid identification of bacterial infections. The company offers bacteria testing kits that include a single-use disposable sensor technology used to detect target molecules and monitor and identify infections at the wound site, enabling veterinarians, and eventually physicians, to improve their diagnoses and treatment plans to provide animal care.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Zack Caporale', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-04 06:47:59', '2025-04-30 08:28:15', '2025-04-30 08:28:15'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002246216', 'LEVY Health', 'LEVY Health', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Caroline Mitterdorfer', 'Developer of a clinical decision support software designed for endocrine disorders, reducing time to diagnosis from years to weeks. The company''s platform utilizes proprietary algorithms and clinical guidelines for infertility diagnostics and individual therapeutic strategies, helping patients with fertility issues to increase their chances of pregnancy.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Have not Reached out', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-04 07:03:13', '2025-05-14 06:34:52', '2025-05-14 06:34:52'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002246240', 'DIA (Therapeutic Devices)', 'DIA (Therapeutic Devices)', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Sloane Tilley', 'Manufacturer of a wearable sensor designed to continuously measure cortisol through ambient levels of sweat on the user''s skin. The company''s products include wearable arm sleeves, and microfluidics technology-based sensors that provide real-time data and frequent testing and can be connected to smartphone applications via Bluetooth, enabling patients to have increased performance and improved health outcomes.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Rejected', NULL, 'Market Outlook', NULL, '2025-02-04 07:07:33', '2026-01-28 11:54:01', '2026-01-28 11:54:01'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002246264', 'Surgicure Technologies', 'Surgicure Technologies', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Irena King', 'Operator of a medical device company intended for airway management for civilian and military use. The company helps medical professionals reduce adverse events by providing devices that optimize patient breathing, improve deployment speed, and contribute to improved safety and quality of care, enabling doctors to perform surgeries efficiently.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Have not Reached out', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-04 07:13:29', '2025-05-14 06:34:49', '2025-05-14 06:34:49'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002246288', 'Sutureguard Medical', 'Sutureguard Medical', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Jen Akeroyd', 'Developer of a retention suture device designed to simplify wound closure. The company''s device closes high-tension wounds without flaps or grafts, simplifies challenging skin wound closure, helps in closing fragile skin wounds without tearing the skin, and results in less damage to the skin than sutures alone, enabling patients to heal wounds in a painless procedure.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-04 07:18:39', '2025-05-14 06:34:29', '2025-05-14 06:34:29'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002246312', 'Alt-Bionics', 'Alt-Bionics', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Judith Colon', 'Operator of a medical device company intended to tackle the problem of high-cost prosthetics by delivering affordable alternatives to the prosthetic market. The company develops affordable bionic prostheses with integrated haptic and visual systems for people with below-elbow amputations or congenital disorders, enabling users to receive real-time feedback by using affordable bionic prosthetic devices.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-04 07:21:41', '2025-05-14 06:34:25', '2025-05-14 06:34:25'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002246340', 'eGlint', NULL, 'Aaditya Jain', 'Denis Malyshev', 'Developer of a miniature biosensing device designed to identify multiple biomarkers in blood. The company''s device uses a small blood volume to derive data on multiple biomarkers present in the sample, enabling the medical industry with an efficient device for identifying biomarkers.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Aadi Jain', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-04 10:06:38', '2025-08-26 07:44:23', '2025-08-26 07:44:23'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002246357', 'Frontier Bio', NULL, 'Aaditya Jain', 'Eric Bennett', 'Developer of lab-grown human tissues intended to replace animal studies and save patients'' lives. The company''s product includes devices that can print with complete cell survivability and no cell death, combining multiple bio-printing technologies into one machine, and replacing animal testing with damaged or diseased human organs, enabling the healthcare industry with bioprinting of some of the most complex human tissues.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Aadi Jain', 'On Hold', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-04 10:17:28', '2025-04-21 09:17:59', '2025-04-21 09:17:59'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002246374', 'InGel Therapeutics', NULL, 'Aaditya Jain', 'Pierre Dromel', 'Developer of engineered cell therapy designed to target neuroprotective pathways to treat retinal degeneration. The company utilizes stem cells and their secretome for neuroprotection for blinding diseases like retinitis pigmentosa and macular degeneration through biodegradable polymers to isolate proteins of neuroprotective significance first in vitro and later in vivo, enabling healthcare professionals to treat the retinal degeneration of patients.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Aadi Jain', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-04 10:32:48', '2025-08-26 07:44:23', '2025-08-26 07:44:23'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002246391', 'Jurata Thin Film', NULL, 'Aaditya Jain', 'Jude Samulski', 'Developer of thin films designed to improve the storage and delivery of vaccines and biologics. The company''s product is a thermostabilizing formulations that allow vaccines and biologics to be stored for long periods at ambient or elevated temperatures, without refrigeration, enabling the healthcare industry to make vaccines and therapeutics more accessible to administer to patients globally.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Aadi Jain', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-04 10:42:19', '2025-08-26 07:44:23', '2025-08-26 07:44:23'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002246408', 'Trace Biosciences', NULL, 'Aaditya Jain', 'Connor Barth', 'Developer of nerve-targeted fluorescent contrast agents designed to guide surgeries and eliminate surgical nerve damage. The company''s agents provide direct highlighting of nerves during surgery in real-time and visualization of nerves buried beneath the surface with high contrast over other tissues, enabling surgeons to see and preserve nerves during critical surgeries.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Aadi Jain', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-04 10:56:39', '2025-09-15 04:52:40', '2025-09-15 04:52:40'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002246425', 'TayCo Brace', NULL, 'Aaditya Jain', 'Gavin Ferlic', 'Manufacturer of a lightweight ankle brace designed to enhance the lives of anyone who has experienced an ankle injury. The company''s brace provides an alternative to traditional, bulky ankle braces as well as uncomfortable walking boots, and casts, and also provides functional recovery for driving, work, and sports, enabling individuals to carry on with their daily activities and reduce the risks of additional injuries through the elimination of limb imbalance.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Aadi Jain', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-04 11:05:17', '2025-08-26 07:44:23', '2025-08-26 07:44:23'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002246442', 'Gisens Biotech', NULL, 'Aaditya Jain', 'Florencia Piccinini', 'Developer of a nanotechnology-based device designed to diagnose and detect renal biomarkers. The company''s platform leverages nanotechnology to develop a device that diagnoses and detects renal biomarkers, providing scientists with real-time and portable health monitoring to measure urea, creatinine, and potassium levels from a single blood drop and track these metrics via an application.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Aadi Jain', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-04 11:30:56', '2025-04-21 09:18:51', '2025-04-21 09:18:51'),
