  ('zcrm_5797994000002252006', 'Pirouette Pharma', NULL, 'Aaditya Jain', 'Conor Cullinane', 'At Pirouette, we have developed a low-profile, disk-shaped, rugged injection device with a patient-centric focus on affordability, portability, and usability. The patented device, based on extensive patient input, is designed to make administering an injection as easy as pushing a button. This allows individuals with limited or no training to easily and intuitively perform an injection on themselves or others.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Aadi Jain', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-04 15:54:07', '2025-09-06 19:11:57', '2025-09-06 19:11:57'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002252023', 'Perch', NULL, 'Aaditya Jain', 'Jacob Rothman', 'Perch maximizes every moment in the weight room to improve athletic performance. We provide a unified solution to create programs, monitor and motivate athletes, analyze results, and make data-informed decisions. Perch is built on top of and far beyond velocity based training. Our product suite includes 3 components :', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare;Sports and Wellness', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Aadi Jain', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-04 16:49:25', '2025-08-26 07:44:23', '2025-08-26 07:44:23'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002252040', 'Laxmi Therapeutic Devices', NULL, 'Aaditya Jain', 'Daniel Hale', 'Laxmi Therapeutic Devices is a developer of a painless patch designed to allow daily continuous glucose monitoring. The company''s painless patch is integrated with 300 microneedles that help in glucose monitoring, enabling automatic insulin control to treat diabetes.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Aadi Jain', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-04 17:18:19', '2025-02-05 15:33:12', '2025-02-05 15:33:12'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002252057', 'IntuBlade', NULL, 'Aaditya Jain', 'Dave Warden', 'IntuBlade is a pioneering medical technology company dedicated to transforming airway management and intubation practices with innovative, AI-enabled solutions. Founded by experienced medical professionals, our flagship product is a next-generation video laryngoscope featuring patented lens-clearing technology and seamless USB-C connectivity.Designed with input from emergency physicians and anesthesiologists, IntuBlade enhances intubation success rates, reduces procedure time, and improves patient safety in critical care scenarios.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Aadi Jain', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-04 17:35:30', '2025-08-26 07:44:23', '2025-08-26 07:44:23'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002252074', 'Zeta Surgical', NULL, 'Aaditya Jain', 'Raahil Sha', 'Zeta Surgical is a digital surgery company focused on improving the accuracy, safety, and accessibility of image guided procedures. Its navigation and robotics platform, Zeta, leverages cutting-edge computer vision and artificial intelligence to enable image guidance directly at the point-of-care, creating new possibilities in fields such asemergency care and interventional medicine. Zeta Surgical was founded by Harvard graduates and faculty and is partnered with leading hospitals and universities.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Aadi Jain', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-04 17:51:59', '2025-08-26 07:44:23', '2025-08-26 07:44:23'),
