  ('zcrm_5797994000002252373', 'Caligenix', NULL, 'Aaditya Jain', 'Ivana Lisjak', 'Caligenix uses genomic and RNA data combined with AI technology to create personalized wellness recommendations. They analyze individual DNA and RNA biomarkers to provide tailored solutions for nutrition, supplements, and skincare. Their approach includes using a fully automated robotics lab for precise testing and feedback, enabling measurable, science-backed wellness improvements for each person based on their unique genetic makeup.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Aadi Jain', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-04 20:06:02', '2025-08-26 07:44:23', '2025-08-26 07:44:23'),
