  ('zcrm_5797994000002252424', 'Grapheton', NULL, 'Aaditya Jain', 'Terry Lingren', 'Grapheton is developing next-generation carbon-based bioelectronic implants that can be used to treat diseases, injuries, and disabilities. These implants are designed to overcome the limitations of traditional metal and polymer implants, which degrade quickly, only measure electrical signals, and create toxic byproducts.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Aadi Jain', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-04 21:23:14', '2025-04-28 09:30:41', '2025-04-28 09:30:41'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002255020', 'ClearCam', 'ClearCam', 'Zachary Caporale', 'Christopher Idelson', 'Developer of medical technologies designed to improve a surgeon''s visual field during surgical procedures. The company offers intra-operative lens cleaner that eliminates the need to remove the laparoscope from the body cavity for lens cleaning attaches to the scope and requires no additional supplies, enabling patients, surgeons, and surgical staff to save procedure time and improve safety.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Zack Caporale', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-05 08:22:06', '2025-04-30 08:28:11', '2025-04-30 08:28:11'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002255044', 'Deeplook medical', 'Deeplook Medical', 'Zachary Caporale', 'Dahn David', 'Developer of a medical imaging platform designed to improve the detection of early breast cancer in mammograms. The company''s platform identifies difficult-to-see data hidden in radiological images, particularly in dense breast tissue, and reveals features that are typically beyond the range of human vision, enabling physicians to decrease the number of unnecessary surgical procedures by reducing the number of false positives from mammography images.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Zack Caporale', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-05 08:29:07', '2025-04-30 08:27:58', '2025-04-30 08:27:58'),
