  ('zcrm_5797994000002256271', 'MailMoo', NULL, 'Jordan Marquez', 'Veeti Roponen', 'MailMoo, founded in 2024 and headquartered in Turku, Finland, is a software-as-a-service (SaaS) company specializing in AI-driven video personalization. The platform enables businesses to create personalized video content at scale, enhancing cold outreach and e-commerce engagement. By allowing companies to record a single video and automate its customization for thousands of recipients, MailMoo aims to improve lead engagement and conversion rates.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Jordan Marquez', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-05 07:24:45', '2025-05-08 10:41:16', '2025-05-08 10:41:16'),
