  ('zcrm_5797994000002256356', 'Ember', NULL, 'Jordan Marquez', 'Aaron Shaw', 'Ember, founded in 2019 by Aaron Shaw and Daniel Hogan, is a UK-based tax-tech startup dedicated to simplifying tax and accounting processes for freelancers, contractors, and small business owners. The platform automates financial administration, offering real-time accounting, tax filing, and unlimited access to financial experts at a fraction of traditional accounting costs. 
